  "Html": "<div><html xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><head><meta charset=\"UTF-8\" /><title></title><meta name=\"Generator\" content=\"PowerTools for Open XML\" /><style>p.s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5P0 {\r\n    margin-top: 0;\r\n    margin-bottom: 0;\r\n    margin-left: 0;\r\n    margin-right: 0;\r\n    text-indent: 0.00in;\r\n    text-align: justify;\r\n    background: white;\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    line-height: 108%;\r\n}\r\nspan.s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0 {\r\n    color: black;\r\n    background: white;\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: normal;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0-000000 {\r\n    color: #0000FF;\r\n    background: white;\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0-000001 {\r\n    color: black;\r\n    background: white;\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: bold;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5000002 {\r\n    color: black;\r\n    background: white;\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: normal;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\nspan.s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0-000003 {\r\n    color: #0000FF;\r\n    background: white;\r\n    font-family: 'Times New Roman', 'serif';\r\n    font-size: 12pt;\r\n    font-style: normal;\r\n    font-weight: normal;\r\n    margin: 0;\r\n    padding: 0;\r\n}\r\n</style></head><body><div><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5P0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\">    </span><a href=\"https://sdlegislature.gov/Rules?Rule=67:10:10:04\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0-000000\">67:10:10:04</span></a><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0-000001\">.  Situations which require adequate notice.</span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\"> </span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\">T</span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\">he department may dispense with timely notice and send an adequate notice</span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\"> if</span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\">:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5P0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5000002\"> </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5P0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\">    (1)  The department has factual information confirming a recipient's or payee's death and there is no relative available to serve as the new payee;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5P0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5000002\"> </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5P0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\">    (2)  The department receives a </span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\">verbal statement, or a </span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\">clear written statement signed by the </span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\">recipient:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5P0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5000002\"> </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5P0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\">        (a)  That the recipient no longer wishes to receive assistance; or</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5P0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\">        (b)  That provides information requiring termination or reduction of assistance;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5P0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5000002\"> </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5P0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\">    (3)  The </span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\">recipient is</span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\"> admitted or committed to </span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\">a mental health facility or correctional</span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\"> institution;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5P0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5000002\"> </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5P0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\">    (4)  The </span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\">recipient is</span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\"> placed in skilled nursing care, intermediate care, or long-term hospital care;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5P0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5000002\"> </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5P0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\">    (5)  The </span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\">recipient's</span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\"> whereabouts are unknown and mail from the department directed to the individual </span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\">is</span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\"> returned by the post office indicating no known forwarding address. The department </span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\">must</span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\"> mail the </span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\">recipient</span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\">'s check to the </span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\">recipient</span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\"> if the whereabouts of the </span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\">recipient</span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\"> become known during the payment period covered by </span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\">the</span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\"> returned check;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5P0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5000002\"> </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5P0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\">    (6)  The </span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\">recipient is</span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\"> accepted for assistance in another state and that fact </span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\">is</span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\"> established by the department;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5P0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5000002\"> </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5P0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\">    (7)  The child </span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\">is</span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\"> removed from the home as a result of a judicial determination or voluntarily placed in an alternative care setting by the child's legal guardian;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5P0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5000002\"> </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5P0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\">    (8)  The department takes action because of information the </span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\">recipient</span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\"> furnished in a report or because the </span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\">recipient</span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\"> failed to submit a complete or timely report as required by § </span><a href=\"https://sdlegislature.gov/Rules?Rule=67:10:05:14\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0-000003\">67:10:05:14</span></a><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\">;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5P0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5000002\"> </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5P0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\">    (9)  The department takes action because of information the individual furnished in an application form;</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5P0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5000002\"> </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5P0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\">    (10)  The recipient of a one-person case has died; or</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5P0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5000002\"> </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5P0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\">    (11)  The parent is participating in a work requirement under the provisions of § </span><a href=\"https://sdlegislature.gov/Rules?Rule=67:10:06:19\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0-000003\">67:10:06:19</span></a><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\"> and will not receive an assistance payment until after completing the required work.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5P0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5000002\"> </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5P0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\">    </span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0-000001\">Source:</span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\"> 24 SDR 24, effective August 31, 1997; portions of this rule were transferred from § </span><a href=\"https://sdlegislature.gov/Rules?Rule=67:10:10:05\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0-000003\">67:10:10:05</span></a><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\">, 26 SDR 168, effective July 1, 2000; 36 SDR 103, effective December 21, 2009</span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\">; 51 SDR 3, effective June 30, 2024</span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\">.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5P0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\">    </span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0-000001\">General Authority:</span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\"> SDCL </span><a href=\"https://sdlegislature.gov/Statutes?Statute=28-7A-3\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0-000003\">28-7A-3</span></a><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\">(12).</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5P0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\">    </span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0-000001\">Law Implemented:</span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\"> SDCL </span><a href=\"https://sdlegislature.gov/Statutes?Statute=28-7A-3\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0-000003\">28-7A-3</span></a><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\">(12).</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5P0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5000002\"> </span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5P0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\">    </span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0-000001\">Cross-References:</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5P0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\">    </span><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\">Full determination of continuing eligibility, § </span><a href=\"https://sdlegislature.gov/Rules?Rule=67:10:01:24\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0-000003\">67:10:01:24</span></a><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\">.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5P0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\">    Timely notice, § </span><a href=\"https://sdlegislature.gov/Rules?Rule=67:10:10:03\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0-000003\">67:10:10:03</span></a><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5C0\">.</span></p><p dir=\"ltr\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5P0\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\" xml:space=\"preserve\" class=\"s473d9334-0522-497e-aacb-2527542e6dc5000002\"> </span></p></div></body></html></div>",
